---
import SiteMenuBehaviour from "../../components/SiteMenuBehaviour.astro";
import { NAV_LINKS, TREATMENT_PAGES, BOOKING_URL, WHATSAPP_URL } from "../../data/site";
const path = "/skin-concerns/acne-scarring-fareham/";
const title = "Acne Scarring & Skin Texture in Fareham | Forever Young Beauty";
const description = "Explore skincare for acne-prone skin, the appearance of certain acne scars and uneven texture in Fareham. Learn about microneedling and Layla's treatment approach.";
const canonical = "https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk" + path;
const schema = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":title,"description":description,"url":canonical,"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"Acne scarring"},{"@type":"Thing","name":"Uneven skin texture"}],"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"Forever Young Beauty by Layla","url":"https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk/"}};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} /></head>
<body>
<header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Forever Young Beauty homepage"><strong>Forever Young Beauty</strong><span>by Layla</span></a><a class="corner-logo" href="/" aria-label="Return to homepage"><img src="/images/fyb-wordmark-1.png" alt="Forever Young Beauty logo" width="62" height="62" loading="eager" /></a><details class="menu"><summary aria-label="Open site menu"><span class="hamburger" aria-hidden="true">☰</span></summary><nav aria-label="Site navigation">{NAV_LINKS.map(l => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}</nav></details></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="inner"><p class="eyebrow">Skincare at Abshot Country Club · Titchfield Common</p><h1>Acne Scarring &amp; Skin Texture Treatments in Fareham</h1><p class="lead">Concerned about marks left by acne or uneven skin texture? Explore the skincare treatments Layla has discussed in her own client posts, and find out which approach may be suitable for your skin.</p><a class="button" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book on Treatwell</a></div></section>
<div class="content">
<section><h2>Acne, acne marks and acne scars are not the same</h2><p>Active breakouts, lingering discolouration and changes in skin texture can need different approaches. Some depressed acne scars may respond to professional treatments, but not every type of scarring is suitable for a beauty treatment. No treatment can promise to erase scars completely.</p></section>
<section><h2>Microneedling for the appearance of certain acne scars</h2><p>Layla has shared microneedling content specifically discussing acne scars, uneven skin texture and fine lines. Microneedling creates controlled micro-injuries to encourage the skin's natural repair response. It may improve the appearance of some depressed acne scars, but results vary and assessment is important.</p><p>Read more about <a href="/treatments/microneedling-fareham/">microneedling in Fareham, including suitability and aftercare</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>BioRePeelCl3 chemical peels and acne-prone skin</h2><p>In a client-transformation post, Layla described a course of five BioRePeelCl3 TCA chemical peel sessions, followed by a different treatment once the client's breakouts were under control. This describes one client's experience, not a standard programme or a promise of results. Chemical peels are not suitable for everyone and require individual advice. Ask Layla whether this treatment is currently offered and appropriate for you.</p></section>
<section><h2>SkinBase microdermabrasion and surface texture</h2><p>Layla also described using a SkinBase microdermabrasion resurfacing facial after the client's breakouts were under control, with the aim of refining the skin's surface. Microdermabrasion primarily exfoliates the surface; it should not be presented as a way to remove deep acne scars. Ask Layla which options are currently available.</p></section>
<section><h2>What should I consider before booking?</h2><p>Tell Layla about active acne, irritation, medication, previous treatments and your skincare routine. Active inflamed acne, infection or other conditions may make some treatments unsuitable. Raised or complex scars, severe acne or persistent symptoms may warrant assessment by a GP or dermatologist.</p><p>For independent information, see <a href="https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/acne/derm-treat/scars/treatment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the American Academy of Dermatology's acne scar treatment guidance</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Skincare near Fareham, Locks Heath and Whiteley</h2><p>Forever Young Beauty by Layla is based at Abshot Country Club, Little Abshot Road, Titchfield Common, Fareham PO14 4LN, convenient for Park Gate, Stubbington, Warsash and nearby Hampshire communities. <a href="/our-location/">See directions and location details</a>.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="client-reviews"><h2 id="client-reviews">What clients say about Layla</h2><p>These are general client reviews about Layla and her approach, not testimonials about acne scarring results.</p><blockquote><p>“Layla is very professional, caring and friendly. She makes sure you are comfortable and relaxed during the treatment. I will definitely be returning on a regular basis.”</p><footer>— Corinne, CACI facial · Treatwell verified review</footer></blockquote><blockquote><p>“Layla is amazing! I have had loads of facials over the years, however this was by far the best. Layla is diligent, knowledgeable and is a wonderful therapist. Thank you!”</p><footer>— Maxine, facial · Google review</footer></blockquote><p>Read more customer feedback directly on <a href="https://www.treatwell.co.uk/place/forever-young-beauty-by-layla/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Layla's Treatwell listing</a>. Individual experiences do not predict treatment outcomes.</p></section>
<section class="contact"><h2>Discuss your skin concerns with Layla</h2><p>For current treatment options and appointment availability, use Treatwell. For questions about whether a treatment suits your skin, contact Layla directly on WhatsApp.</p><p><a class="button" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book on Treatwell</a></p><p><a href={WHATSAPP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Layla →</a></p></section>
<nav aria-label="Other treatments"><h2>Explore more treatments</h2><div class="links">{TREATMENT_PAGES.map(t => <a href={t.href}>{t.label} →</a>)}</div></nav>
</div></main><footer><a href="/">Forever Young Beauty by Layla</a> · Titchfield Common, Fareham</footer><SiteMenuBehaviour /><script src="/booking-tracking.js" defer></script>
</body></html>
